+does not exclude numeric schema/provider guards from future tunable-policy review.
+Unknown platform `O_NOFOLLOW` fallback race guarantees remain unsupported until
+actual platform evidence is provided. No lexical or count-only closure occurred.
+
+Initial script index/syntax/validator-API mistakes have uniquely named raw failure
